"""Stated-goal detector for layers.1.mlp.down_proj:5836 (v6).

Negative where the text states what must be done: "we need to", "the task/goal/aim
is to", "to find / prove / show", "required to", "see if". Those cues carry most of
the strong negative spikes. A small word lexicon adds a weak negative for task and
problem-solving words and a weak positive for first-person and appearance words.
Magnitudes are roughly the mean activation each cue produces on text, scaled by SCALE.
