"""Approximate a sparse formatting signal, leaving ordinary text near zero.

Predict negative document starts and positive pulses at title endings,
indentation, short quotes/emphasis, list markers, and chat/metadata boundaries.
A few initial code/markup forms and the leading number 12 are exceptional.
The constants are empirical averages, not an account of lexical variation.
