"""A coarse syntax-and-boundary predictor; most tokens receive zero.

Positive responses mark code member access after calls/subscripts and ordinary
chat endings. Chinese possessive/aspect particles get context-dependent negative
responses, stronger after a nearby relative-clause marker. Restriction words and
