English noun heads after several noun/adjective/name modifiers get positive
values, especially named organizations, buildings and awards. A separate rule
handles decimal suffix digits in version, license and code notation. Document
starts are suppressed, except for the colon in an initial Title: field.
Unrecognized text receives a near-zero prediction; this is not a multilingual
parser or a complete account of the component's lexical preferences.
