A singleton space finishing a split whitespace run gives the main positive
response.  Smaller rules recognize comment markers and filesystem paths.
Document-leading title fields, carriage returns and decorative dot leaders
have separate responses.  Other document-initial words get a small negative
baseline; most other tokens get zero.  All state resets between documents.
"""
READS = ()

